{
  "_comment": "Shared routing cases. Run by tests/ranch-command/ranch.test.mjs against js/events.js and by edge/ranch-command/tests/test_routing.py against ranch_edge/routing.py, so the browser and the edge box cannot drift apart.",
  "cases": [
